+<a id="agents-configuration"></a>
+<a id="agents-studio"></a>
+
+### Agent Definitions Studio Configuration Table
+
+| Field Name | What It Controls | Allowed Values / Format | Default | Security / Operational Impact |
+| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
+| `agent_name` | Unique name and identifier for the autonomous agent | String (1 to 64 characters) | Required | Used in ticket mentions, activity streams, and assignment cards |
+| `system_prompt` | Core instructions, persona guidelines, and security boundaries | UTF-8 Markdown text | Required | Directs model reasoning; stripped of dangerous injection sequences |
+| `execution_harness` | Runtime environment executing agent invocations | `api_direct`, `cli_pipe`, `remote_runner` | `api_direct` | `cli_pipe` uses zero-shell `agy -p` or `codex -p` in Linux jail |
+| `cli_pipe_binary` | Binary path used for zero-shell CLI pipe harness | Pre-approved binary name (`agy`, `codex`) | `agy` | Executes without shell or bash; communicates strictly over STDIN/STDOUT |
